my favourite thing since becoming a streamer is runing TTRPGS for the people i have meet.🫶

So I made a podcast of us playing our silly little games so they will be on the internet for our enjoyment (and hopefully others as well 😌)

@what-dice-is-that.bsky.social

(Pt 1) Made a little comic of what really happened after their last DnD campaign’:0

Jane didn’t die and she gave Will a pep talk while Max gave Mike a pep talk to make them go to castle Byers (2.0) to sort their stuff out because that’s what I’d rather believe happened ;-;

